


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_f64a2b55:



    voice "2AR_0002"
    arthur "「汪」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_83f297c3:



    voice "2HI_1410"
    hina "「嗯，不要紧，应该没受伤……嗯嗯……之后会带它回店里的。好，那回头见」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_cbe53395:



    voice "2HI_1411"
    hina "「呼」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_fd33d708:


    "阳菜松了口气，合上了手机。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_0dd9373e:


    "话说这是结实的翻盖手机啊。完美防水和抗摔的那种。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_94e00284:



    voice "2HI_1412"
    hina "「浅生心里的大石头终于落下了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_c66864f6:



    voice "2RI_1411"
    rin "「太好了。那看好店里关门时间再过去吧。亚瑟没法上公交车，只能走过去了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_d2e384b4:



    voice "2HI_1413"
    hina "「是啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_fc34cc4b:


    "但即使算上走路的时间也不需要立马出发。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_c0543174:



    voice "2HI_1414"
    hina "「……所以，你要谈什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_1edd2c60:


    "阳菜收好手机后，面向伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_890ad212:



    voice "2RI_1412"
    rin "「呃……刚才差不多都说完了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_d5be3b47:



    voice "2HI_1415"
    hina "「啊哈哈哈」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_799a4e7d:



    voice "2RI_1413"
    rin "「……就是想说那些」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_5be8dc6e:


    "阳菜笑了出来。伦沮丧地撇着嘴。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_e20d50fb:



    voice "2HI_1416"
    hina "「谢谢你」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_96c08204:



    voice "2RI_1414"
    rin "「嗯？干嘛道谢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_d762ae3c:



    voice "2HI_1417"
    hina "「你有好好考虑过我、还有我们俩的事情啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_81fe1c78:



    voice "2RI_1415"
    rin "「那当然会考虑啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_ef7a7e04:



    voice "2HI_1418"
    hina "「我还以为伦完全没当回事」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_8dbad69d:



    voice "2RI_1416"
    rin "「好过分……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_ba97c33c:


    "但阳菜说对了一半。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_0c3f0536:



    voice "2HI_1419"
    hina "「之前听圣夜子说了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_da1b2f89:



    voice "2RI_1417"
    rin "「圣夜夜？之前是多久之前？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_e2d36155:



    voice "2HI_1420"
    hina "「几天前。就是我们两个人单独回来的那天」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_842c8257:



    voice "2RI_1418"
    rin "「啊……是阳菜把我甩了那天啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_177e1da1:



    voice "2HI_1421"
    hina "「才没甩啦！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_384392b1:



    voice "2RI_1419"
    rin "「但是你说不想做嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_b7686821:



    voice "2HI_1422"
    hina "「不是。我是以为伦已经不想再和我做了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_a783d051:



    voice "2RI_1420"
    rin "「怎么回事？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_3a21df7b:



    voice "2HI_1423"
    hina "「我以为你其实是不想做的，但在勉强自己配合我。这么一想就觉得很对不起你……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_9d5a169d:



    voice "2RI_1421"
    rin "「怎么可能。我一直都很想做的！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_c3f1f230:


    "只对这种事坦率也有点微妙吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_5777fd3e:



    voice "2HI_1424"
    hina "「但你拒绝了我两次」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_64a73c22:



    voice "2RI_1422"
    rin "「那些都事出有因啦！第一次是因为生理原因。能做的话就做了！第二次是因为有点害怕，所以……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_df7ad82a:



    voice "2HI_1425"
    hina "「所以我以为是只有自己想做……就像是动物一样」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_1cd6cd94:


    "……母狗？"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_b5f09ee8:



    voice "2RI_1423"
    rin "「那为什么不愿意戴项圈？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_969677b1:



    voice "2HI_1426"
    hina "「因为这样的我配不上伦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_697bb4f9:



    voice "2RI_1424"
    rin "「怎么可能配不上啊。你太钻牛角尖了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_63543fac:



    voice "2HI_1427"
    hina "「……伦不说的话我也不知道啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_478f41f7:


    "两人陷入沉默。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_3d165037:



    voice "2RI_1425"
    rin "「……跑题了。你和圣夜夜说了什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_7536b108:


    "伦努力挽回。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_b99b076b:



    voice "2HI_1428"
    hina "「圣夜子说了之前伦和她说的话」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_273fc7c7:



    voice "2RI_1426"
    rin "「什么时候说的话？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_71ac4a7c:



    voice "2HI_1429"
    hina "「我当时戴着耳机，被你用糖从后面打了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_56c9858f:



    voice "2RI_1427"
    rin "「诶……那些你都听到了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_6f7b688a:



    voice "2HI_1430"
    hina "「没。所以圣夜子转告我了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_7e4b2307:



    voice "2RI_1428"
    rin "「她告诉了你多少？虽然我有种不好的预感」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_1d9ce022:



    voice "2HI_1431"
    hina "「她说“伦说很喜欢你”」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_55e23441:



    voice "2RI_1429"
    rin "「……圣夜夜这个大嘴巴」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_511d4bd2:



    voice "2HI_1432"
    hina "「但是，我很开心」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_8907f824:



    voice "2RI_1430"
    rin "「……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_5a4e3b8a:



    voice "2HI_1433"
    hina "「一被伦抚摸，我的大脑立刻就会一片空白。这样真的好吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_5a6233fb:



    voice "2RI_1431"
    rin "「这样才好！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_01202fe2:



    voice "2HI_1434"
    hina "「这样啊。我想多听你说这些事嘛～」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_b6a7bdac:



    voice "2RI_1432"
    rin "「我说啊，要是能说出口，我的性格就不会这么扭曲了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_d8d67b41:



    voice "2HI_1435"
    hina "「这句她也和我说了。九十八分之一什么的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_9cc63b21:



    voice "2RI_1433"
    rin "「啊，现在大概是九十六分之一」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_21d607ae:



    voice "2HI_1436"
    hina "「微增啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_2030b0ab:



    voice "2RI_1434"
    rin "「嘿呀！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_fc241d36:


    "伦顺势站起身。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_c6de61c7:



    voice "2HI_1437"
    hina "「怎么了？要做吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_aeed1a54:



    voice "2RI_1435"
    rin "「呃……做肯定是会做……的吧。但先活动一下身体」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_d95a9ec3:



    voice "2HI_1438"
    hina "「诶、做的时候也要活动身体啊？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_20a3b3c9:



    voice "2RI_1436"
    rin "「不是那个意思。我想飞，飞得很高很高。现在情绪高涨，情不自禁啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_132ee183:


    "说着就在原地蹦跶起来。伦这样真罕见。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_4a78a143:



    voice "2HI_1439"
    hina "「不太懂你的意思……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_1383055e:



    voice "2RI_1437"
    rin "「好嘞！来跳舞吧，阳菜！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_f40d893e:


    "伦伸出手。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_98924d71:



    voice "2HI_1440"
    hina "「诶、跳芭蕾吗？我没有节奏感……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_deb1427b:



    voice "2RI_1438"
    rin "「今天我会好好教你的，没关系！交给我吧！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_5c7f1cfe:


    "伦更用力地伸出手；阳菜战战兢兢地牵上了她的手。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_409ab9f0:



    voice "2RI_1439"
    rin "「在此之前——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_de637d93:


    "伦比平常更恭敬地奉上项圈，而阳菜则比平常更顺从地接受了——"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_cac502ca:



    voice "2HI_1441"
    hina "「呜哇啊啊！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_be60c185:


    "伦环起阳菜的腰，咚地迈出一大步，跳了起来。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_eca1b7d5:


    "然后两个人在教堂的走道上哒哒地跳起来，时而前进，时而后退。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_997209d8:



    voice "2RI_1440"
    rin "「好轻啊～都可以把你扔到天花板上去了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_b0fd6e78:



    voice "2HI_1442"
    hina "「咿咿咿！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_ca3f764b:



    voice "2RI_1441"
    rin "「啊哈哈，骗你的啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_b685cd67:


    "伦兴高采烈地放声大笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_873b47b5:



    voice "2HI_1443"
    hina "「突、突然之间怎么了，伦？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_31b61f37:


    "阳菜对伦一反既往的高昂情绪感到困惑。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_6835925b:



    voice "2RI_1442"
    rin "「阳菜不是说过想一起跳吗？所以现在就跳呗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_a91a0c4d:



    voice "2HI_1444"
    hina "「我是说过……但那个时候你不是生气了嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_2f31730f:



    voice "2RI_1443"
    rin "「那是因为在起居室不能跃起、不能跳高，没法跳啊。再说当时也是深夜了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_d1c3e2dc:



    voice "2HI_1445"
    hina "「但是伦说不擅长和别人共舞……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_b9bb0a01:



    voice "2RI_1444"
    rin "「是啊。不过，和阳菜跳就无所谓吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_278c7e29:


    "……………"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_e7f96e90:


    "伦一边说着，一边领导着阳菜翩翩起舞。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_eac735f9:


    "激进的舞步安稳下来变得安静，节奏变得柔和。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_e5976d50:



    voice "2RI_1445"
    rin "「芭蕾的事……不，不只是芭蕾。谢谢你一直以来的夸奖。阳菜一直都只注视着我呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_60ddbd7d:



    voice "2HI_1446"
    hina "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_36f07d26:



    voice "2RI_1446"
    rin "「有时候我会因此感到害怕啊。因为我并不完美，总有一天会被你看穿自己糟糕的一面」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_2f0c8013:



    voice "2HI_1447"
    hina "「总有一天？我早就看了一堆了。赖床、挑食、邋里邋遢、丢三落四、很容易得意忘形、而且好色——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_cece26bc:



    voice "2RI_1447"
    rin "「停。已经够了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_dea38130:



    voice "2HI_1448"
    hina "「但是，这些我也都喜欢哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_0df130b7:


    "阳菜在伦的带动下呼啦呼啦地转着圈，但她的视线依然不偏不倚地注视着伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_fb6c7bec:



    voice "2RI_1448"
    rin "「谢……谢谢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_27667c31:


    "伦则是勉强忍住了错开视线的冲动。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_cb01e627:



    voice "2RI_1449"
    rin "「阳菜能直视着对方说这番话呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_5cb705af:



    voice "2HI_1449"
    hina "「嗯，因为是和伦说啊。为什么突然提这个？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_3a39372a:



    voice "2RI_1450"
    rin "「没有……就觉得阳菜果然很厉害」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_2c8006a1:



    voice "2HI_1450"
    hina "「伦比我厉害多了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_89cc961d:


    "伦在阳菜的额头上落下一吻。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_b8291e29:



    voice "2HI_1451"
    hina "「啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_435607b3:



    voice "2RI_1451"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_a14e7131:



    voice "2HI_1452"
    hina "「唔，你是不是打算敷衍我？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_790f17e7:



    voice "2RI_1452"
    rin "「为、为什么这么说？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_6e7edf69:



    voice "2HI_1453"
    hina "「伦每次突然亲我的时候都是这样的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_0e29ccaf:



    voice "2RI_1453"
    rin "「你太敏锐了吧……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_0a5747fb:


    "从第一次接吻的时候起就是这样吧。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_2b08430b:



    voice "2HI_1454"
    hina "「好好用嘴啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_ae317a94:



    voice "2RI_1454"
    rin "「亲嘴？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_29d8367f:



    voice "2HI_1455"
    hina "「不是——！是让你用嘴说！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_a50b9d02:



    voice "2RI_1455"
    rin "「咕嘎！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_c19a08e3:


    "阳菜用额头锤向伦的嘴边，把吻变成了头槌。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_30457ebd:



    voice "2HI_1456"
    hina "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_2a8e887e:


    "阳菜抬着头，直勾勾地注视着伦。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_271a1991:



    voice "2RI_1456"
    rin "「我知道了……我不会再错开视线了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_7469decc:


    "手牵得更紧。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_7974ebb6:



    voice "2RI_1457"
    rin "「我……喜欢阳菜」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_9bed40d4:


    "阳菜的表情豁然开朗。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_8ebf5df4:



    voice "2HI_1457"
    hina "「伦！喜欢喜欢喜欢！最喜欢！！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_218842a5:


    "这是几倍奉还啊？"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_b2c97851:



    voice "2RI_1458"
    rin "「噢，这不是挺好的嘛，身体变软了。你多信用我一点啦，放轻松」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_d5710755:



    voice "2HI_1458"
    hina "「不重吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_c0d91e1d:



    voice "2RI_1459"
    rin "「完全不重。像天使一样轻」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_3de0d328:


    "尚未习惯舞蹈的阳菜，渐渐放松了紧绷的身体。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_332369a4:


    "比起芭蕾，两个人更像是在跳交际舞和探戈舞，不过这都无所谓。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_ec84afca:


    "这里不是表演会。两人也不是为了博得谁人赏识而舞蹈。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_21ffb0b7:


    "她们只是随着身体由内而外溢出的感情，按照自由的节奏，在这教堂翩翩起舞。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_a2059594:



    voice "2HI_1459"
    hina "「感觉变得有意思了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_154bf773:


    "阳菜的身体能力本来就很好，现在她追上了伦的领舞动作，掌握了领导权。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_122ff392:



    voice "2HI_1460"
    hina "「哟、哈、嚯！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_535eaa5c:



    voice "2RI_1460"
    rin "「这数拍子的声音也太不雅致了吧……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_43abb699:



    voice "2HI_1461"
    hina "「不行吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_51c2afe4:



    voice "2RI_1461"
    rin "「呼呼。没有不行，你想怎么来就怎么来！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_27beef3b:



    voice "2HI_1462"
    hina "「呜哇！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_eca53cc8:


    "伦呼啦呼啦地转起圈，头发也如漩涡般随之舞动。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_04d852ce:



    voice "2HI_1463"
    hina "「啊哈哈哈哈哈♪」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_314ee317:


    "两人替换的时候，阳菜都会哈哈大笑，像是被哄开心的孩子。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_5b8327c5:



    voice "2RI_1462"
    rin "「这下……反倒是我明天会挂彩吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_39c2e966:


    "与阳菜不同，平常缺乏锻炼的伦开始担心肌肉酸痛的问题。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_08b93a34:



    voice "2RI_1463"
