translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_129ffb7f:



    voice "2RI_1472"
    rin "「被阳菜咬伤后感染啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_a540a114:


    "说着，伦展示起自己的手指。伤痕已经淡了很多，只是依稀可见。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_efe2f05e:



    voice "2HI_1472"
    hina "「呀！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_002c8840:


