translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_25f5acfa:



    voice "2RI_1473"
    rin "「伤脑筋的是，我这条狼啊，不管有没有月亮都会暴露本性的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou2_09_3153be04:



